From 9a528b2cf44de81148d8799ff2fcb598ce44a47e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NFCSTORE CI <ci@nfcstore.uz>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:47:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 71/72] Nova: "Lentada ko'tarish" (FEATURED) Android'da ham
 yopiq
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Narx va "reklama saytda rasmiylashtiriladi" yozuvi olib tashlangach
FEATURED ekranida faqat kunlar ro'yxati qoladi — foydali narsa yo'q.
iPhone'dagidek:

- Yangi `showFeaturedEntry` (`false`, `store_policy.dart`).
- Post ostidagi "Lentada ko'tarish" tugmasi Android'da ham chizilmaydi.
- `/featured/:kind/:id` ikkala platformada bosh sahifaga buriladi.
- iPhone'dagi Apple consumable "Ko'tarish" (IAP) o'zgarmagan.
- Sinovlar: tugma va marshrut kalit ortida; Android router sinovida
  `/featured/...` -> `/`.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
